<nav class="category-tabs" aria-label="Battle categories"><a href="/game/battle" aria-current="page">Attack Rivals</a><a href="/game/bounties">Bounty List (<span data-bounty-count data-next-expiry="<%= nextBountyExpiry??'' %>"><%= bountyCount %></span>)</a></nav>
<p class="compact-help">Attack costs <strong>1 Spirit</strong>. You need at least <%= alpha.combat.minimumHealth %> Health; the defender needs positive Health. Victory depends on character strength, participating army and automatically selected equipment.</p>
<div class="battle-summary"><span>Your attack <strong><%= state.attack %></strong></span><span>Defense <strong><%= state.defense %></strong></span><span>Army <strong><%= state.army.participants %></strong></span></div>
<% const actorReady=state.health>=alpha.combat.minimumHealth&&state.spirit>=alpha.combat.spiritCost; %>
<% if (!actorReady) { %><p class="notice notice-info">Recover Health or Spirit to attack again. Resources update automatically.</p><% } %>
<section class="panel rival-panel"><h2 class="strip-title"><span>Army</span><span>Army size</span><span>Attack</span></h2>
<% if (!opponents.length) { %><div class="empty-state"><p>No rivals in your level range yet. Invite another player to the realm, or quest while you wait.</p><a href="/game/quests" class="button button-outline">Return to quests</a></div><% } %>
<% for (const opponent of opponents) { %><article class="rival-row"><div><h3><a class="player-link" href="/game/players/<%= opponent.id %>"><%= opponent.name %></a></h3><span>Level <%= opponent.level %> <%= opponent.className %></span><small><%= opponent.health %> / <%= opponent.maxHealth %> Health</small><% if(opponent.botTier) { %><small class="bot-label">Temporary rival · <%= opponent.botTier %></small><% } %><%- include('partials/bounty-placement',{target:opponent}) %></div><strong><%= opponent.armySize %></strong><form method="post" action="/game/battle/attack"><%- include('partials/command-fields') %><input type="hidden" name="targetCharacterId" value="<%= opponent.id %>"><button class="button button-gold" type="submit" aria-label="Attack <%= opponent.name %>" data-attack-ready="<%= opponent.health>=community.combat.defenderMinimumHealth?'true':'false' %>"<% if (!actorReady||opponent.health<community.combat.defenderMinimumHealth) { %> disabled<% } %>>Attack</button></form></article><% } %>
<% if (nextOpponentCursor) { %><a class="button button-outline" href="/game/battle?after=<%= encodeURIComponent(nextOpponentCursor) %>">More rivals</a><% } %>
</section><p class="compact-help">Victory steals 3% of unbanked gold, capped at 5,000 before diminishing returns: 100%, 75%, 50%, 25%, then 10%. The fixed sequence resets 24 hours after its first victory. Defeats steal nothing; Vault gold is protected. XP retains its three-encounter limit. <a href="/game/battle">Refresh rivals ›</a></p>
<%- include('partials/history') %>

<% if(developmentBotsEnabled) { %><p class="compact-help bot-disclosure">Temporary rivals are passive computer-controlled opponents: they never initiate attacks. With the development recruitment flag enabled, they can accept invitations. At most six rewarded bot encounters per 24 hours and one per bot; later victories still earn 1 XP and use normal Spirit and Health, but ordinary gold is capped at zero. They have at most 10 army members, recover Health naturally, and use level-appropriate equipment. Their saved Land earns income; attacks never refill their purses. <%= developmentBotBountiesEnabled?'Player-funded bot bounties are enabled; bots never fund or claim contracts.':'Bot bounty targets are disabled by development configuration.' %></p><% } %>
